{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Applies one exact-match edit to a control facet (html, css, or js) and records it in the control's append-only patch journal. old_snippet must match the current source exactly once (absent or ambiguous: error, no write); an empty old_snippet creates or replaces the whole facet, including when the facet does not exist yet. If base (a hash from read_control_facet) is supplied and stale, returns status err with msg stale_base and the current_hash - re-read and retry. One edit per call; make multiple calls for multiple edits. Returns the new content hash and the journal patch_id.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"facet","type":"String"},{"name":"old_snippet","type":"String"},{"name":"new_snippet","type":"String"},{"name":"base","type":"String"},{"name":"label","type":"String"},{"name":"author","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"uyonls19f95a61d2cp3945","readers":[],"time":1786375264782,"username":"system","writers":[]}